WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,430 --> 00:00:01,390
what do you want

2
00:00:02,520 --> 00:00:05,090
If I want something, I really want to give it to you

3
00:00:05,090 --> 00:00:06,770
Then give me one blow and kill three hundred people.

4
00:00:06,770 --> 00:00:08,130
You don’t even bring a maki yaki knife, do you?

5
00:00:09,700 --> 00:00:10,940
Are you preparing to be alone?

6
00:00:10,940 --> 00:00:11,940
finish the work

7
00:00:12,420 --> 00:00:13,380
That's what I thought

8
00:00:13,780 --> 00:00:15,060
But I don’t know if it can be done

9
00:00:16,060 --> 00:00:17,340
You are also a talent

10
00:00:18,420 --> 00:00:19,940
Built with century-old suspended iron

11
00:00:20,500 --> 00:00:21,940
I'll lend it to you for the time being.

12
00:00:22,810 --> 00:00:23,730
So willing

13
00:00:24,420 --> 00:00:26,300
Aren't you afraid that I won't be able to complete my mission?

14
00:00:26,420 --> 00:00:28,500
Let this knife be used by Luoyun Buluo to cause a small disaster

15
00:00:30,110 --> 00:00:33,110
At first I thought you were crazy but last thought

16
00:00:33,110 --> 00:00:34,150
You are such a smart person

17
00:00:34,150 --> 00:00:35,950
I shouldn’t do anything I’m not sure about.

18
00:00:36,190 --> 00:00:37,550
So I blocked you from coming back

19
00:00:37,550 --> 00:00:39,270
If I lose, I'll lose a knife at most.

20
00:00:39,550 --> 00:00:43,260
If you lose, you'll lose your life.

21
00:00:43,700 --> 00:00:44,860
Mingming and ordinary lead to the knife

22
00:00:44,860 --> 00:00:46,020
look exactly the same

23
00:00:46,380 --> 00:00:48,540
But the weight is seven to eight times that of an ordinary Zhiqing knife.
